  "body": "* 4 bedrooms | 2 bathrooms + guest toilet | 1 lounge | 1 office | 1 internal-access garage\r\n* Approx. 166sqm floor area on an approx. 190sqm freehold section\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living with easy indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Master suite with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and private balcony\r\n* Additional upstairs sitting area for flexible family living\r\n* Central air conditioning, underfloor heating in bathrooms and pre-wired EV charging\r\n* North-west aspect with excellent afternoon sunshine and a peaceful reserve outlook\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed modern living, this brand-new home at 325 Te Taruna Drive combines a practical family-friendly layout with a sunny aspect and peaceful reserve surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor provides a welcoming hub for everyday life, with the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area bringing everyone together. Filled with natural light, this inviting space flows easily through to the outdoor deck, creating a seamless connection for entertaining, family gatherings or simply enjoying a quiet afternoon at home.\r\n\r\nThe well-appointed kitchen offers a stylish and functional setting for everyday living, featuring generous bench space, quality appliances and excellent storage. Whether preparing family meals or hosting friends, its thoughtful layout makes every day feel that little bit easier.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the additional sitting area provides a useful second space away from the main living zone. It can easily adapt to your needs as a reading nook, study area, children's retreat or quiet place to relax. The master suite enjoys its own private balcony overlooking the peaceful surroundings, complemented by a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Three further bedrooms and a well-appointed family bathroom complete the upper level, providing comfortable accommodation for family and guests.\r\n\r\nModern comforts have been thoughtfully included throughout, with central air conditioning, underfloor heating in the bathrooms, a convenient guest toilet, intercom and pre-wiring for an EV charger. An internal-access single garage with storage and a laundry nook adds further practicality to the home.\r\n\r\nWith its desirable north-west aspect, excellent afternoon sunshine and easy-care design, this home offers a relaxed lifestyle in the growing Milldale community. Local schools, parks, walking tracks, cafés, shops and motorway access are all within easy reach, making everyday living both convenient and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
